---
import TradeCharacter from "../homepage/TradeCharacter.astro";
import StoryIcon from "../homepage/StoryIcon.astro";
---
<section class="ib-hero"><div class="ib-shell ib-hero__grid"><div class="ib-hero__copy"><p class="ib-kicker">Barbers and grooming parlors</p><h1>Turn missed haircut calls into <em>booked chairs</em> and returning regulars.</h1><p class="ib-lede">Never lose track of a client while holding shears. Chakusa connects enquiries, chair appointments, customer notes, reviews, and the next return visit.</p><div class="ib-actions"><a class="ui-button ui-button--primary" href="/get-started">Start free trial <StoryIcon name="arrow_forward" /></a><a class="ui-button ui-button--secondary" href="#barber-workflow">See how Chakusa works</a></div><p class="ib-proof">First 14 days free. Choose the plan that fits your business.</p><dl class="ib-metrics"><div><dt>Enquiries</dt><dd>Captured</dd></div><div><dt>Bookings</dt><dd>Connected</dd></div><div><dt>Regulars</dt><dd>Remembered</dd></div></dl></div><div class="ib-scene" aria-label="Animated illustration of a barber using Chakusa"><div class="ib-scene__grid"></div><div class="ib-scene__halo"></div><TradeCharacter class="ib-scene__character" /><aside class="ib-scene__call"><StoryIcon name="phone_missed" /><span><small>Missed call captured</small><strong>Skin fade enquiry</strong></span><b>NEW</b></aside><aside class="ib-scene__booking"><StoryIcon name="event_available" /><span><small>Chair confirmed</small><strong>Today at 3:15 PM</strong></span><b>BOOKED</b></aside></div></div></section>
